<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: center">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0 0pt 0.5in; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in">&ldquo;<U>Registration
Statement</U>&rdquo; means, collectively, the various parts of the registration statement prepared by the Company on Form F-1 (File No.
333- 294161) with respect to the Securities, each as amended as of the date hereof, including the Prospectus and Prospectus Supplement,
if any, the Preliminary Prospectus, if any, and all exhibits filed with or incorporated by reference into such registration statement,
and includes any Rule 462(b) Registration Statement.</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0 0pt 0.5in; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in">&nbsp;</P>

